      "text": "%md\n\nBecause wdi_opencsv_text uses standard DELIMITED formatting (not OpenCSV), it writes data as raw text without quotes or escaping.\n\nHence, again we have a table having the indicatorcode column with incorrectly parsed values.\n\nSee you in the next episode of this data cleaning series!",
